<title>UK: UK's GEC chairman Lord Prior to retire.</title>
<headline>UK's GEC chairman Lord Prior to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronics giant General Electric Company Plc said on Thursday its chairman Jim Prior would retire at the end of the current financial year.</p>
<p>&quot;The procedure to appoint a new chairman is progressing,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
